      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "set-head-restored",
      "label": "/collection/sets — scrolled back to where the head reopens",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/collection/sets/${PROBE_SET}",
          "settle": 3500,
          "wait": "[data-set-head]"
        },
        {
          "scroll": 600,
          "settle": 700
        },
        {
          "scroll": 200,
          "settle": 700
        }
      ],
      "widths": [
        "phone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "set-filters-sheet",
      "label": "/collection/sets — Filters sheet over a scrolled grid",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/collection/sets/${PROBE_SET}",
          "settle": 3500,
          "wait": "[data-set-head]"
        },
        {
          "scroll": 600,
          "settle": 700
        },
        {
          "click": "main button[aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"]:visible",
          "wait": "[role=dialog]",
          "settle": 800
        }
      ],
      "widths": [
        "phone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "commander-detail-foot",
      "label": "/commanders/[slug] — the foot of the column and the Build bar",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/commanders/${PROBE_COMMANDER_SLUG}",
          "settle": 4000,
          "wait": "main, [role=main], h1"
        },
        {
          "scroll": "bottom",
          "settle": 900
        }
      ],
      "widths": [
        "phone"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "collection-sort-popover-desktop",
      "label": "/collection — the Sort popover, desktop form",
      "widths": [
        "desktop"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/collection",
          "settle": 3000,
          "wait": "main, [role=main], h1"
        },
        {
          "scroll": 400,
          "settle": 400
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "button",
          "name": "^Sort cards",
          "wait": "[role=dialog]",
          "settle": 800
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "note": "Steps are Playwright verbs, and a row may name the widths it exists at. No account's ids are committed: the set page takes PROBE_SET and the commander page PROBE_COMMANDER_SLUG from the environment. The filter sheets are phone surfaces — at 1300 the same controls are popovers or an inline row, so those rows are shot at 390 only and the desktop form has a row of its own. A trigger selector is scoped to `main`: the shell's account control carries the same `aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"` at phone width and comes first in document order, so an unscoped row photographs the account sheet and reports success."
}